      "text": "Reports to: BCL SQ/CC\n\nSupervises: BCL FLT/CD, BCL Cadets\n\nCritical Role: Primary contact for all BCL Cadets, serving as the evaluator and mentor for flight members.\n\nResponsibilities:\n\n• Acting as a mentor and focusing on individual Cadet improvement.\n\n• Responsible for exemplifying regulations and enforcing GMC adherence to standards.\n\n• Facilitates and reports attendance to BCL SQ/CC for all SPMT events.\n\n• Conducts feedback sessions for GMC cadets within the flight (ACAs, CEFs, etc.).\n\n• Regularly collects and reports GMC feedback to the BCL SQ/CC\n\n• Ensures completion of Flight duties (i.e., wing room cleanup and flags) and facilitates proper training of all cadets to achieve this.\n\n• Assign flight positions weekly.\n\n• Receives Warrior Knowledge quizzes from BCL SQ/CC and distributes them to the flight.\n\n• Works with BCL SQ/CC to help create and edit extra LLABs for BCL cadets.\n\n• Create BCL WK quiz and supplemental info for the week",
