      "text": "Reports to: WG/CC\n\nSupervises: FLT/CC\n\nCritical Role: Oversees the week-by-week tasking, instruction, and feedback of the BCL FLT/CCs.\n\nResponsibilities:\n\n• Works with BCL SQ/CC to create and maintain a cadet flight roster.\n\n• Evaluates and completes ACAs and CEFs for BC FLT/CCs.\n\n• Monitors the BC flights’ performance and reports patterns and trends to the WG/CC or WG/CD.\n\n• Plans and executes flight meetings with the approval of the WG/CC, WG/CD.\n\n• Creates formal opportunities for feedback sessions for BCL cadets.\n\n• Works with BCL SQ/CC to assign weekly flight duties.\n\n• Works with BCL SQ/CC to maintain the attendance tracker.\n\n• Responsible for ensuring that attendance is reported by FLT/CCs for all SPMT events.\n\n• Works with BCL SQ/CC to standardize wingroom cleanup checklist and enforcement of completed duty.\n\n• Create BC WK quiz and supplemental info for the week",
