      "text": "Reports to: WG/COS\n\nSupervises: FSO\n\nCritical Role: Oversees and mentors A32-35, ensuring their progress, development, and planning are being performed to high standards.\n\nResponsibilities:\n\n• Provide weekly current-event briefings to the entire Detachment.\n\n• Report changes in AFROTC policy to WG/COS.\n\n• Publish a weekly newsletter detailing current events applicable to the USAF/USSF – including updates and events happening in and around the Detachment.\n\n• Plans and runs the semester long detachment wargaming event.\n\n• In coordination with FSO, communicates with Iowa State University IT about any updates or maintenance requests for the Flight Simulators.",
